 		    uke_last_panic_text());
+
+		/*
+		 * uke-stall-probe liveness: the timer interrupt samples the interrupted PC from early
+		 * boot on, so a non-zero count proves the sampler is armed and last_pc says where the
+		 * boot was at the moment of this call. A zero count is the one answer that would make a
+		 * later "still no panic" uninformative.
+		 */
